@TourGuide.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5063

### Nearby places around Puerta del Sol, Madrid
GET {{TourGuide.Api_HostAddress}}/api/places/nearby?lat=40.4168&lon=-3.7038
Accept: application/json

### Nearby places with a custom radius (meters)
GET {{TourGuide.Api_HostAddress}}/api/places/nearby?lat=40.4168&lon=-3.7038&radius=300
Accept: application/json

### Invalid latitude, returns 400
GET {{TourGuide.Api_HostAddress}}/api/places/nearby?lat=100&lon=0
Accept: application/json

###
